              Surface treatment for corrosive industrial environments is selected based on project environment category, client specification and applicable standards. Options include multi-coat paint systems, hot-dip galvanizing (for components fitting galvanizing bath dimensions), and project-specific coating systems for highly corrosive conditions. The appropriate system is determined by the project's corrosion category, design service life and client requirements. We do not provide fixed corrosion lifespan guarantees without project-specific engineering analysis.
            </div>
